OL,3,A'I'd be the last to know': Stars of The
OL,4,AGentlemen react to Meghan reports
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has been almost two weeks since
OL,7,Freports emerged that the Duchess of
OL,8,FSussex was in talks for a role in The
OL,9,FGentlemen.
OL,11,FAt the world premiere for series two of
OL,12,Fthe Netflix show on Wednesday night,
OL,13,Fstars including Maya Jama, Hugh
OL,14,FBonneville and Theo James remained
OL,15,Ftight-lipped about the prospect of
OL,16,FMeghan joining the cast.
OL,18,F"It's fascinating to watch, but
OL,19,Fultimately it's a lot of rumour," James
OL,20,Ftold BBC News, while Jama said: "I'd be
OL,21,Fthe last person to know!"
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,162,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11911
SC,0011
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1788409165
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'I'd be the last to know': Stars of The
OL,4,AGentlemen react to Meghan reports
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe show's executive producer said he
OL,7,Fdidn't want to say yes or no to the
OL,8,Freports about Meghan, but added they
OL,9,Fwere looking forward to "more energy
OL,10,Fand surprises" to come.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
