OL,3,ALizzo 'grateful' after judge dismisses
OL,4,Alawsuit against production company
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS pop star Lizzo has spoken out after
OL,7,Fthe remaining claims in a lawsuit
OL,8,Fagainst her production company were
OL,9,Fthrown out by a US district judge.
OL,11,FThe singer's former wardrobe assistant
OL,12,FAsha Daniels alleged she had been
OL,13,Fsubjected to "degradation, forced
OL,14,Fphysical labor, denial of medical care,
OL,15,Fsexual harassment, and racial
OL,16,Fharassment" while briefly working for
OL,17,FBig Grrrl Big Touring in 2023.
OL,19,FDistrict judge Fernando L Aenlle-Rocha
OL,20,Ffiled a ruling to dismiss the claims by
OL,21,Fthe stylist on Tuesday, according to
OL,22,Fcourt documents.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11913
SC,0013
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1788409165
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ALizzo 'grateful' after judge dismisses
OL,4,Alawsuit against production company
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn an Instagram post, Lizzo said she
OL,7,Fwas "relieved" at the outcome and will
OL,8,F"continue to fight" every claim made
OL,9,Fagainst her and her company.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
